      "content": "i feel like i don't even exist anymore. like everyone i knew just... collectively decided i wasn't real? one day i was part of everything and now it's just silence. i'm sitting here staring at my phone and there is nothing. no one. it's like i've been erased but i'm still stuck in this body. it's so heavy.",
